5771-25/39031495_582094936911306_6800017255329826407_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vsg03bfQTFsQ7kNvwEmuD0B&_nc_oc=AdpwseN5W329urRGxvnc-2ENtFRUNF-aseLFyDv6skDJw-7CrwqNYKTj4lwRo-6jDi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRz2PwnosHn8Hn0edq_2TVGohsltbe_hvHO-czOj3IyHQ&oe=6B071D63"}, "display_name": "Archery Land", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DtHtJgXXd0QQ7kNvwFNfilJ&_nc_oc=AdqcyF-RqgpMlpCkgi8XFfPtWI08Jsd_Wzdx7ZlkiLYY_r6jLmF3zFTA9NO28XYdI4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnBiws9_tKXn1_adkDQexz62PRRkI47MhN10SiK_w7uw&oe=6B071A01"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ODqV8bEZFV0Q7kNvwFUBGz1&_nc_oc=AdpJGwlgPakcEM-KNllwzRbZ583PLiNnstMPqgCP_cXd3uXMGNqmB7mSv0M3yOmPSKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht